      <p source="#source-607-675"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-607-634"><rb>凶会日</rb><rt>くゑにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-634-637">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-637-664"><rb>凶会日</rb><rt>くゑにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-664-675">と見て</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-675-719"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-675-687"><rb>病</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-687-719">めるもの衰へしもの、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-719-775"><seg source="#source-719-725">床の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-725-737"><rb>上</rb><rt>へ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-737-752">にすなほに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-752-767"><rb>僵</rb><rt>たふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-767-775">れ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-775-822"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775-790"><rb>瓶</rb><rt>かめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-790-822">の身は砕けてちりて、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-822-860"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-822-843"><rb>滅亡</rb><rt>ほろび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-843-860">に入らむ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-860-931"><seg source="#source-860-866">床の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-866-878"><rb>上</rb><rt>へ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-878-881">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-881-893"><rb>破</rb><rt>わ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-893-902">れぬ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-902-926"><rb>花瓶</rb><rt>はながめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-926-931">、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-931-978">されどそが『こゝろ』は如何に、</p>
      <p source="#source-978-1022"><seg source="#source-978-1022">すなほにと云へど、やさしき、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1022-1072"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1022-1037"><rb>砕</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1037-1072">けにはあらず、はげしく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1072-1097"><seg source="#source-1072-1097">叫ぶを聞きぬ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1097-1144"><seg source="#source-1097-1109">人の子は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1109-1124"><rb>瓶</rb><rt>かめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1124-1144">にもあらず、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1144-1218"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1144-1168"><rb>運命</rb><rt>うんめい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1168-1171">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1171-1195"><rb>運命</rb><rt>うんめい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1195-1198">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1198-1210"><rb>観</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1210-1218">て、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1218-1268"><seg source="#source-1218-1251">秋のくれ、死ぬるといふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1251-1263"><rb>夜</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1263-1268">、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1268-1330"><seg source="#source-1268-1283">ほのかなる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1283-1298"><rb>燭</rb><rt>そく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1298-1301">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1301-1313"><rb>火</rb><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1313-1330">のかげに、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1330-1371"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1330-1354"><rb>題目</rb><rt>だいもく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1354-1371">をこそ――</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1371-1421"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1371-1395"><rb>蝋燭</rb><rt>ろうそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1395-1421">はかすかに音し、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1421-1468"><seg source="#source-1421-1445">黄ばむ火は寒げに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1445-1457"><rb>揺</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457-1468">れぬ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1468-1527"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1468-1492"><rb>刻々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-1477-1483">こく</seg><choice source="#source-1483-1489"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1492-1495">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1495-1510"><rb>面</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1510-1527">がはりゆく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1527-1595"><seg source="#source-1527-1533">あゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1533-1554"><rb>死相</rb><rt>しさう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1554-1560">――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1560-1581"><rb>刹那</rb><rt>せつな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1581-1595">よ黒く、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1595-1632"><seg source="#source-1595-1604">つくは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1604-1625"><rb>呻吟</rb><rt>うめき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1625-1632">。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1632-1694"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1632-1656"><rb>破瓶</rb><rt>われがめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1656-1659">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1659-1677"><rb>画師</rb><rt>えし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1677-1694">うち抱き、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1694-1759"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1694-1718"><rb>死人</rb><rt>しにびと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1718-1721">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1721-1742"><rb>法師</rb><rt>ほふし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1742-1759">みちびき、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1759-1818"><seg source="#source-1759-1774">秋の野へ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1774-1789"><rb>葬</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1789-1795">りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1795-1810"><rb>途</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1810-1818">に、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1818-1874"><seg source="#source-1818-1845">また聞きぬ、見ぬ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1845-1869"><rb>黒牛</rb><rt>くろうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1869-1874">の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1874-1907"><seg source="#source-1874-1883">これも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1883-1904"><rb>呻吟</rb><rt>うめき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1904-1907">。</seg></p>
    </body>
